@startuml
title ERC-2771 Gasless Flow (Sequence)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true

actor User as U
participant "DApp Frontend\n(Web/App)" as FE
participant "Wallet / Signer\n(EIP-712)" as W
participant "Relayer API\n(gas sponsor)" as R
participant "Trusted Forwarder\n(MinimalForwarder)" as F
participant "Recipient Contract\n(ERC2771Context)" as RC

U -> FE : Initiate action (e.g., Mint)
FE -> W : Prepare EIP-712 typed data\nForwardRequest{from,to,value,gas,nonce,data}
W --> FE : Signature (sig)

FE -> R : POST /relay {request, sig}
R -> F : execute(request, sig)\n(pays gas)

F -> F : verify(request, sig)\n- domain separator\n- chainId\n- nonce check\n- ecrecover

F -> RC : low-level call(to, data||sender)\nmsg.sender = F
RC -> RC : business logic with _msgSender()\n(= original user)
RC --> F : return data / success

F --> R : receipt / status
R --> FE : tx hash / status
FE --> U : Success UI (no ETH needed)

== Error paths ==
F --> R : revert (invalid sig / bad nonce / out of gas)
R --> FE : error response
@enduml
